{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready and grab your metal detector because the search has begun. In the different locations show your skills by adapting to the terrain in each situation. Upgrade your tools in the shop and return better equipped to the beach, forest, mountains, ruins, or island. All kinds of objects could be buried, from gold rings to ancient coins. And while you search... you can also relax and admire the landscape. Hundreds of hidden treasures are waiting to be found. What are you still doing standing there? Let's go, let's search!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954080/extras/0ae9d6f1e04642817b6ac4ce1e7d8261.poster.avif?t=1763241900\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954080/extras/0ae9d6f1e04642817b6ac4ce1e7d8261.webm?t=1763241900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954080/extras/0ae9d6f1e04642817b6ac4ce1e7d8261.mp4?t=1763241900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954080/b45e4c884943e11596695f1d7b5fe1989d5cd6c5.jpg"},{"name":"1st Mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954080/ed39265a419cf26da4f71f823a59d92b985d3358.jpg"},{"name":"2nd Mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954080/1b7789b4812e24ebd4662e832999ca8405ec957c.jpg"},{"name":"3rd Mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954080/93f351e9eef2b4fc120351e47ac0ea81d765b713.jpg"},{"name":"4th Mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954080/45b996208ff0ddc49e